'''Wall of Wind''' is a wind-type [[Spells|spell]] invented by [[Alaira]] that creates a circular wall of air that is difficult to pass thorough.

==Description==
Wall of wind contains a central air sigil with a cluster of inverted column signs in the front of the seal, and several convergence signs at the back, along with a semicircular sign with small details on it's edges located around the air sigil on the column half of the seal. This spell creates a circular wall of air, which is difficult for objects or people to penetrate, and can be used to contain people or animals.{{Ref|m|28|20}}

==Usage==
The spell was first seen used by [[Tetia]] to briefly hold the transformed [[Euini]] in place {{Ref|m|28|20}} so she could restrain him with [[Sand Cage|sand cage]].{{Ref|m|28|21}} This allowed [[Agott]] to carry out the next step in their plan to attempt and return Euini to back to normal.

